items.code:
useRef = a persistent box whose .current value can change without causing a re-render.
For your intermediate React level, you should be comfortable with these three patterns:
// 1. DOM reference
const inputRef = useRef(null);
inputRef.current.focus();
// 2. Persistent mutable value
const timerRef = useRef(null);
timerRef.current = setTimeout(...);
// 3. Remembering a previous value
const previousValue = useRef();
That is the core of useRef.

